Package: smiDE
Title: Differential Expression Analysis for spatial SC data 
Version: 0.0.2.04
Description: Faciliate flexible specification of Differential Expression regression models suitable for spatially-resolved transcriptomic (SRT) data analysis. This package also provides tools for addressing challenges specific to SRT data, including segmentation errors and correlation among neighboring cells, which may lead naiive regression models to inflate statistical significance.
Depends: 
    R (>= 2.10)
